<title>LATVIA: LODE H1 1997 NET PROFIT 162,056 LATS.</title>
<headline>LODE H1 1997 NET PROFIT 162,056 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brickmaker Lode had a first-half net profit of 162,056 lats, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the bourse said that Lode's net turnover was 896,281 lats in the first half of the year.  </p>
<p>The company also had total expenses of 356,416 lats and had profits before extraordinary items and taxes of 167,299 lats.</p>
<p>The company's assets came to 1.46 million lats and it had short-term debts of 147,456 lats with no long-term debts.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
